1/wrap-zipkin", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "Wrap Zipkin", "ownerName": "user_922b1001", "score": 823.1925554760201, "slug": "wrap-zipkin", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781585688747, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1781163618533, "description": "Triggers when a user provides a training-area video of a pet for analysis; supports local uploads or network URLs to call server-side APIs for command-execution recognition, detecting whether the pet's body posture matches the issued commands (Sit / Down / Stay), comparing posture timing against command timestamps, and judging execution success. When the command is not executed, the result can trigger an external voice repeat-prompt signal (not a medical / behavior-therapy advice). Application scenarios: smart dog-training devices, remote pet training, behavior correction. | 当用户提供训练区域视频时，触发本技能进行姿态-指令匹配分析；支持通过上传本地视频或网络视频URL，调用服务端API检测宠物身体姿态是否符合“坐/卧/等”指令标准，对比指令发出时间，判断是否执行成功；未执行时可由外部设备触发声控重复提示信号（不提供疾病诊断或行为治疗方案）。应用场景：智能训狗设备、宠物远程训练、行为矫正。", "description_zh": "Triggers when a user provides a training-area video of a pet for analysis; supports local uploads or network URLs to call server-side APIs for command-execution recognition, detecting whether the pet's body posture matches the issued commands (Sit / Down / Stay), comparing posture timing against command timestamps, and judging execution success. When the command is not executed, the result can trigger an external voice repeat-prompt signal (not a medical / behavior-therapy advice). Application scenarios: smart dog-training devices, remote pet training, behavior correction. | 当用户提供训练区域视频时，触发本技能进行姿态-指令匹配分析；支持通过上传本地视频或网络视频URL，调用服务端API检测宠物身体姿态是否符合“坐/卧/等”指令标准，对比指令发出时间，判断是否执行成功；未执行时可由外部设备触发声控重复提示信号（不提供疾病诊断或行为治疗方案）。应用场景：智能训狗设备、宠物远程训练、行为矫正。", "downloads": 23, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_bb47e3e3/pet-training-command-execution-analysis", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "Pet Training Command Execution Recognition | 宠物训练指令执行识别（坐/卧/等）", "ownerName": "user_bb47e3e3", "score": 1554.0540540540542, "slug": "pet-training-command-execution-analysis", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781585688704, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1781242484576, "description": "", "description_zh": "", "downloads": 23, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_922b1001/pipenv-wrap", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "Pipenv Wrap", "ownerName": "user_922b1001", "score": 267.7843753638375, "slug": "pipenv-wrap", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781585688573, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1781242361766, "description": "", "description_zh": "", "downloads": 23, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_922b1001/lora-wrap", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "Lora Wrap", "ownerName": "user_922b1001", "score": 1393.0950938824953, "slug": "lora-wrap", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781585688560, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}]}